    <div class="row">
      <div><label>Stepped limit above (ft)</label><input id="stepAlt" type="number" step="1000" inputmode="decimal"></div>
      <div><label>Stepped MMO (Mach)</label><input id="stepMach" type="number" step="0.01" inputmode="decimal"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="err" id="err-step"></div>
    <div class="hint">Enter BOTH if your AFM has a stepped limit. When in doubt between two limits, fly the <b>more restrictive</b> one.</div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="card"><h2 data-acc>Weight &amp; stall speed <span class="arw">–</span></h2><div class="body">
    <label>Stall speed at reference weight (KIAS)</label>
    <input id="vsRef" type="number" step="1" inputmode="decimal">
