# 💾 `icing-calculator.html` — Complete Self‑Contained Build

**Zero external libraries. Zero network requests. One file. Works offline forever.**

---

## 📥 HOW TO SAVE IT

### On a desktop (Windows / Mac / Linux)
1. Open **Notepad** (Windows) or **TextEdit** (Mac — switch to *Plain Text* mode with `Format ▸ Make Plain Text`, or it will add smart quotes and break the code).
2. Select **all** the code in the block below and paste it.
3. `File ▸ Save As` → filename **`icing-calculator.html`** → **Save As type: All Files** (so it doesn't become `icing-calculator.html.txt`).
4. Double-click the file. It opens in your default browser.

### On a phone or tablet (iPhone / iPad / Android)
1. Open the code below, select all, copy.
2. **iPhone/iPad:** paste into **Notes** or **Files → new text file** → rename to `icing-calculator.html` → then in **Files**, tap it and choose *Share ▸ Open in…* → your browser. Better still: open it in **Safari** and use **Share ▸ Add to Home Screen** — it then runs full-screen with no browser chrome, exactly like an app.
3. **Android:** paste into any text editor, save as `icing-calculator.html`, then open with Chrome (choose *Files* if prompted), and use **⋮ ▸ Add to Home screen**.

### Quick sanity check after saving
Open it and press **REFERENCE → Run self test**. You should see **ALL CHECKS PASSED**. If any line says FAIL, you pasted incompletely (usually a stray smart quote or a missing `</script>`).

> **Note on smart quotes:** if you use a word processor rather than a plain text editor, it may convert `"` to `"` and break the JavaScript. Notepad and TextEdit-in-plain-text are safe. On Mac, if you paste into TextEdit, use `Format ▸ Make Plain Text` **before** pasting.

---

## THE COMPLETE FILE

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
<title>Coffin Corner — Icing &amp; Speed Band Calculator v1.2</title>
<style>
/* ============ THEME ============ */
:root{
  --bg:#090e14;--p1:#111a24;--p2:#18242f;--p3:#0c141c;--ln:#27394a;--tx:#dce7f2;--dm:#8ba1b8;
  --am:#ffb020;--rd:#ff5252;--gr:#3ddc84;--bl:#63b8ff;--gy:#66788c;--pu:#c9a7ff;
  --sh:rgba(0,0,0,.45);
}
html[data-theme="light"]{
  --bg:#eef2f6;--p1:#ffffff;--p2:#f2f6fa;--p3:#ffffff;--ln:#c3d2e0;--tx:#16222e;--dm:#4a5f75;
  --am:#a86200;--rd:#c62828;--gr:#17794a;--bl:#0b63a8;--gy:#6b7c8f;--pu:#6a3fa0;
  --sh:rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);font:15px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom)}
.wrap{max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 10px 40px}
h1{font-size:clamp(15px,2.4vw,20px);margin:0;letter-spacing:.3px}
h1 b{color:var(--am)}
.sub{color:var(--dm);font-size:11.5px}
header{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:2px solid var(--am);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:9px}
button,select,input{font:inherit}
.btn{background:var(--p2);border:1px solid var(--ln);color:var(--tx);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 11px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--am)}
.btn.sm{padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px}
.btn.tog{border-color:var(--am);color:var(--am)}
.banner{background:var(--p3);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-left:5px solid var(--rd);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:10px}
.banner b{color:var(--rd)}
html[data-theme="light"] .banner b{color:#c62828}
/* tabs */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{flex:1;min-width:96px;text-align:center;padding:10px 8px;border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:7px;background:var(--p1);color:var(--dm);cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.8px;font-size:12.5px}
.tab.on{background:var(--am);color:#11181f;border-color:var(--am)}
html[data-theme="light"] .tab.on{color:#fff}
.pane{display:none}.pane.on{display:block}
/* layout */
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(310px,370px) 1fr;gap:11px;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:960px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.card{background:var(--p1);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
.card>h2{margin:0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--am);background:var(--p2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;user-select:none}
.card>h2 span.arw{color:var(--gy);font-size:11px}
.card .body{padding:10px}
details.card>summary{list-style:none;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:1.1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--am);background:var(--p2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
details.card>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
/* inputs */
label{display:block;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dm);margin:9px 0 3px;letter-spacing:.2px}
label:first-child{margin-top:0}
input,select{width:100%;padding:9px 9px;background:var(--p3);border:1px solid var(--ln);color:var(--tx);border-radius:5px;font-size:16px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
input:focus,select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--am)}
input.bad{border-color:var(--rd);background:rgba(255,82,82,.09)}
.row{display:flex;gap:8px}.row>*{flex:1;min-width:0}
.stepper{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:stretch}
.stepper button{flex:0 0 38px;background:var(--p2);border:1px solid var(--ln);color:var(--tx);border-radius:5px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
.stepper button:active{background:var(--am);color:#11181f}
.stepper input{flex:1;min-width:0;text-align:center}
.hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--gy);margin-top:3px;line-height:1.35}
.err{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--rd);margin-top:3px;display:none}
.err.show{display:block}
.warn{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--am);margin-top:3px;display:none}
.warn.show{display:block}
.btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
/* verdict */
.verdict{border-radius:8px;padding:11px 13px;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(17px,3.4vw,23px);letter-spacing:.4px;margin-bottom:10px;border:2px solid}
.v-go{background:rgba(61,220,132,.13);border-color:var(--gr);color:var(--gr)}
.v-caution{background:rgba(255,176,32,.13);border-color:var(--am);color:var(--am)}
.v-no{background:rgba(255,82,82,.14);border-color:var(--rd);color:var(--rd)}
.verdict small{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--dm);margin-top:5px;line-height:1.45}
/* kv */
.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(148px,1fr));gap:7px}
.k{background:var(--p2);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 9px}
.k .l{font-size:10px;color:var(--dm);letter-spacing:.4px;text-transform:uppercase}
.k .v{font-size:clamp(17px,2.6vw,20px);font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin-top:2px}
.k .s{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gy);margin-top:1px;line-height:1.3}
.k.good .v{color:var(--gr)}.k.warn .v{color:var(--am)}.k.bad .v{color:var(--rd)}.k.info .v{color:var(--bl)}.k.neut .v{color:var(--tx)}
/* tables */
.tw{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
th,td{padding:5px 6px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);white-space:nowrap}
th{color:var(--dm);font-weight:600;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-transform:uppercase;position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--p2)}
th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left;white-space:normal}
tr.tot td{font-weight:700;border-top:1px solid var(--ln)}
/* band graphic */
.track{position:relative;height:42px;background:var(--p3);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:5px;margin:18px 0 4px}
.zone{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0}
.zraw{background:rgba(255,176,32,.15);border-left:1px dashed rgba(255,176,32,.55);border-right:1px dashed rgba(255,176,32,.55)}
.zsafe{background:rgba(61,220,132,.25);border-left:2px solid var(--gr);border-right:2px solid var(--gr)}
.mk{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;transform:translateX(-1.5px)}
.mk.st{background:var(--rd)}.mk.cl{background:var(--rd)}
.mk.cu{width:0;height:0;border-left:7px solid transparent;border-right:7px solid transparent;border-top:12px solid #fff;top:auto;bottom:-2px;transform:translateX(-7px)}
.lab{position:absolute;top:2px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;text-shadow:0 0 4px var(--p3)}
.lab.st,.lab.cl{color:var(--rd)}.lab.cur{color:var(--tx);bottom:15px;top:auto}
.scale{position:relative;height:14px;font-size:10px;color:var(--gy)}
.scale span{position:absolute;transform:translateX(-50%)}
/* notices */
.nb{border-left:4px solid var(--am);background:rgba(255,176,32,.09);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:7px}
.nb.bad{border-left-color:var(--rd);background:rgba(255,82,82,.1)}
.nb.info{border-left-color:var(--bl);background:rgba(99,184,255,.09)}
.nb.ok{border-left-color:var(--gr);background:rgba(61,220,132,.09)}
/* working */
pre.eq{background:var(--p3);border:1px solid var(--ln);padding:9px;border-radius:6px;font-size:11.5px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;margin:6px 0;line-height:1.55;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace}
pre.eq b{color:var(--am)}
pre.eq i{color:var(--bl);font-style:normal}
