    <h1>COFFIN CORNER — <b>ICING &amp; SPEED BAND CALCULATOR</b></h1>
    <div class="sub">High-altitude speed band · stall &amp; overspeed margin · dynamic pressure · go/no-go &nbsp;|&nbsp; v1.3 · offline, no libraries</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <span class="chip wait" id="status">LOADING…</span>
