<b>STUDY AID — NOT AN APPROVED DOCUMENT.</b> Not a substitute for the AFM/POH, the operator's manual, or a briefing.
Preset values are <b>ILLUSTRATIVE</b> and come from a commentary chart, not certified data — replace every one with your own AFM figures.
Dynamic pressure is a structural-load proxy, not a certified limit.
