    <div class="hint">Enter BOTH if your AFM has a stepped limit. When in doubt between two limits, fly the <b>more restrictive</b> one.</div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="card"><h2 data-acc>Weight &amp; stall speed <span class="arw">–</span></h2><div class="body">
    <label>Stall speed at reference weight (KIAS)</label>
