    <div class="stepper"><button type="button" data-t="oat" data-d="-1">−</button><input id="oat" type="number" step="1" inputmode="decimal"><button type="button" data-t="oat" data-d="1">+</button></div>
    <div class="err" id="err-oat"></div><div class="warn" id="warn-oat"></div>
    <div class="hint">OAT changes Mach, TAS and q — but <b>not</b> the IAS at a given Mach and pressure altitude.</div>

    <label>Ice stall-speed penalty (%)</label>
    <div class="stepper"><button type="button" data-t="ice" data-d="-1">−</button><input id="ice" type="number" step="1" min="0" max="60" inputmode="decimal" value="0"><button type="button" data-t="ice" data-d="1">+</button></div>
