**8. Standing offer:** if you'd rather stop fighting the paste, I can rebuild this as a **leaner v2.0** with a much smaller footprint (roughly half the size), the UI generated in JavaScript so a mangled body can't hurt it, and ASCII‑only source. Say the word and I'll do it — but I'd rather first confirm which of the two failure modes you're actually in, because a rebuild won't fix a UTF‑16 save.

